<title>USA: Somanetics offering registration effective.</title>
<headline>Somanetics offering registration effective.</headline>
<dateline>TROY, Mich. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Somanetics Corp said Friday its registration statement filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a public share offering is effective.</p>
<p>The company said it will offer two million primary common shares and an additional 300,000 to cover over-allotments at a price of $4.00 a share.</p>
<p>Proceeds will finance company operations, including marketing and sales activities, research and development programs and other general corporate purposes, Somanetics said.</p>
<p>The managing underwriter for the offering is New York-based Brean Murray &amp; Co.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
